<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank 14-day rev repo rate 14.22 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank 14-day rev repo rate 14.22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Tuesday the average rate in its 14-day reverse repo tender, its first of such a maturity, hit 14.22 percent.</p>
<p>The NBS added it had drained funds totalling 3.25 billion crowns through the operation.</p>
